    "username": "emollick",
    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "I have read a lot of science fiction and nobody really anticipated AIs in the way we have them.\n\nI mean, you can project ahead to Culture Minds or Golem XIV etc., but the current &amp; immediate future, where statistical models of language do the things that they do, seems unexpected",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/emollick/status/2081586847327588465",
    "time": "2026-07-27 11:45",
