    "id_str": "2081586847327588465",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "emollick",
    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "There are lots of lessons to be learned from science fiction predictions of superintelligence, etc. But nobody really got the technology and weird edges right, as far as I can recall. https://t.co/jIDrXdjppG",
