    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "They are obviously very jagged intelligences. Goldman Sachs is very good at some things and very bad at others.\n\nThey are also remarkably hard to talk to, the CEO is a temporary figure in the lifespan of the organization, and even the founder loses control of the entity they made",
